{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Reference","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:12RegexBuilder9ReferenceV","modules":[{"name":"RegexBuilder"}],"title":"Reference","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"name":"iOS"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"name":"macOS"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Reference","kind":"identifier"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RegexComponent"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference\/init(_:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference\/regex"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Captures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Capture","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/TryCapture"],"title":"Captures"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Reference","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Capture","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use a "},{"code":"Reference","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to access a regular expression, both during"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the matching process and after a capture has been successful."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this example, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kind"},{"type":"text","text":" reference captures either "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"CREDIT\""},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"DEBIT\""},{"type":"text","text":" at the beginning of a line. Later in the regular expression, the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presence of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kind"},{"type":"text","text":" matches the same substring that was captured previously"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at the end of the line."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let kindRef = Reference(Substring.self)","let kindRegex = ChoiceOf {","    \"CREDIT\"","    \"DEBIT\"","}","","let transactionRegex = Regex {","    Anchor.startOfLine","    Capture(kindRegex, as: kindRef)","    OneOrMore(.anyNonNewline)","    kindRef","    Anchor.endOfLine","}","","let validTransaction = \"CREDIT     109912311421    Payroll   $69.73  CREDIT\"","let invalidTransaction = \"DEBIT     00522142123    Expense   $5.17  CREDIT\"","","print(validTransaction.contains(transactionRegex))","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(invalidTransaction.contains(transactionRegex))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any reference that is used for matching must be captured elsewhere in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Regex"},{"type":"text","text":" block. You can use a reference for matching before it is captured;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in that case, the reference will not match until it has previously been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"captured."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To access the captured “transaction kind”, you can use the "},{"code":"kind","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to subscript a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Regex.Match"},{"type":"text","text":" instance:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if let match = validTransaction.firstMatch(of: transactionRegex) {","    print(match[kindRef])","}","\/\/ Prints \"CREDIT\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to capture a transformed value, include a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closure when capturing."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Transaction {","    var id: UInt64","}","let transactionRef = Reference(Transaction.self)","","let transactionIDRegex = Regex {","    Capture(kindRegex, as: kindRef)","    OneOrMore(.whitespace)","    TryCapture(as: transactionRef) {","        OneOrMore(.digit)","    } transform: { str in","        UInt64(str).map(Transaction.init(id:))","    }","    OneOrMore(.anyNonNewline)","    kindRef","    Anchor.endOfLine","}","","if let match = validTransaction.firstMatch(of: transactionIDRegex) {","    print(match[transactionRef])","}","\/\/ Prints \"Transaction(id: 109912311421)\""],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/reference"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A reference to a captured portion of a regular expression."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/TryCapture":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A regex component that attempts to transform a matched substring, saving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the result if successful and backtracking if the transformation fails."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TryCapture","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"TryCapture","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TryCapture","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/trycapture","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/TryCapture"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/RegexComponent":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"RegexComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"RegexComponent","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/regexcomponent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that represents a regular expression."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RegexComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RegexComponent"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/Reference/init(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"init(_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"Capture","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12RegexBuilder9ReferenceV7Capturexmfp"},{"text":".Type)","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a reference with the specified capture type."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference\/init(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/reference\/init(_:)"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder":{"abstract":[],"title":"RegexBuilder","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/Capture":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Capture","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A regex component that saves the matched substring, or a transformed result,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for access in a regex match."}],"title":"Capture","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/capture","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Capture"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Capture"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/Reference":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Reference"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A reference to a captured portion of a regular expression."}],"title":"Reference","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/reference","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Reference","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/Reference/regex":{"url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/reference\/regex","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference\/regex","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"regex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Regex","preciseIdentifier":"s:17_StringProcessing5RegexV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Capture","preciseIdentifier":"s:12RegexBuilder9ReferenceV7Capturexmfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"regex"}}